<title>HUNGARY: MOL 1996 IAS net income HUF 22.2 bln - full table.</title>
<headline>MOL 1996 IAS net income HUF 22.2 bln - full table.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	 26,635   vs    6,401</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	   25,310   vs	939</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	 21,275   vs	998</p>
<p>    Group net income		 22,247   vs    1,170</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 502,869   vs  369,994</p>
<p>    Group other revenues	   11,397   vs    3,488</p>
<p>    Material expenditures	 327,642   vs  244,122</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	 37,237   vs   31,284</p>
<p>    Depreciation,amortization    27,524   vs   29,760</p>
<p>    Other costs			18,032   vs   13,743</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	     83,157   vs   56,543</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    1,325 loss vs 5,462 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue		6,007   vs    3,098</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure	  7,332   vs    8,560</p>
<p>    Tax payable			 4,035   vs	 59</p>
<p>NOTE - MOL Rt is an oil and gas company. These figures were prepared in accordance with International Accounting Standards, they are consolidated. The 1996 figures</p>
<p>are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
